/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2436:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:79:        description: "孤立像素移动后留下的轨迹不是背景色，而是其对应半包围精灵的边框颜色。这增加了颜色对应关系的推理——解题者需要确定每个孤立像素与哪个精灵关联。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2437:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:113:    current: "辐射射线延伸到网格边缘终止；孤立像素同样移动到网格边缘"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2438:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:165:    current: "obstacle_blocking——第二步变换中，第一步的精灵（含填充后的区域）作为障碍物阻挡孤立像素的直线路径"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2439:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:168:        description: "孤立像素遇到精灵障碍物时不是被阻挡停止，而是绕过障碍物（沿障碍物边缘移动后继续原方向）。这引入了绕行路径的推理，解题者需要确定绕行路线。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2440:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:173:        description: "孤立像素遇到精灵障碍物时像光线一样反射——垂直撞击则水平偏转，水平撞击则垂直偏转。反射后继续移动至网格边缘。增加了弹射路径的推理。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2441:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:178:        description: "取消障碍物阻挡机制，孤立像素直接穿过其他精灵继续前进至网格边缘。这简化了逻辑但在视觉上孤立像素轨迹会覆盖精灵像素，解题者需要理解层叠关系。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2442:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:182:      - name: "障碍物吸收孤立像素并变色"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2443:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:183:        description: "孤立像素到达障碍精灵时被吸收，障碍精灵的填充区域变为孤立像素的颜色。这是一种颜色传递机制，解题者需要追踪颜色流动的方向和效果。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2445:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:238:    current: "两步处理：第一步填充半包围区域并辐射，第二步孤立像素直线移动（第一步结果作为障碍物影响第二步）"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2446:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:240:      - name: "先移动孤立像素再填充辐射"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2447:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:241:        description: "反转两步的处理顺序：先让孤立像素移动到网格边缘，然后再填充半包围区域并辐射。由于顺序不同，孤立像素不受精灵阻挡。解题者需要推断正确的步骤顺序。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2448:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:251:        description: "将当前的两步拆为三步：第一步仅填充所有半包围区域（不辐射），第二步从所有填充区域向开口辐射，第三步移动孤立像素。每一步的结果影响下一步。增加了推理的层次性。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2449:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:262:    name: "孤立像素与精灵的关联规则"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2450:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:264:    current: "孤立像素位于半包围区域的瓶颈（开口）外侧，沿辐射方向排列，隐式关联到最近的精灵"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2451:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:267:        description: "孤立像素通过颜色与精灵关联——孤立像素颜色与精灵内源像素颜色相同时才建立关联。不同颜色的孤立像素对应不同精灵。解题者需要通过颜色配对来确定关联关系。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2452:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:272:        description: "孤立像素与曼哈顿距离最近的半包围精灵关联，不限于开口方向。这使关联规则更灵活但需要解题者进行距离计算。位于两个精灵等距位置的孤立像素可增加歧义推理。"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2453:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:276:      - name: "无孤立像素（单步变换）"
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16_rerun1.log:2454:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/yaml/dim_analysis_v9_b9e38dc0.yaml:277:        description: "完全移除孤立像素和第二步变换，只保留半包围区域的填充和辐射。这大幅简化了任务，但作为基础变体有助于理解核心机制。"
