/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:32:  - 当前值: 两步处理：第一步填充半包围区域并辐射，第二步孤立像素直线移动（第一步结果作为障碍物影响第二步）
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:52:    Fill the region enclosed by a wall sprite and radiate color outward through its opening.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:59:    - Obstacles cast "shadows" along the radiate direction, blocking fill behind them.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:61:    Key insight: The wall endpoints define the opening direction; fill radiates outward through it, and obstacles block propagation along that same axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:219:    # Shadow behind obstacles (non-bg, non-fill, non-wall) along radiate direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:268:GRID_H_VERT = (11, 18)       # height range when radiate_dir is vertical
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:269:GRID_H_HORIZ = (8, 18)       # height range when radiate_dir is horizontal
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:275:DEPTH_VERT = (5, 10)          # arm depth range for vertical radiate
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:276:DEPTH_HORIZ = (6, 8)          # arm depth range for horizontal radiate
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:277:GAP_VERT = (6, 7)             # endpoint gap for vertical radiate
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:278:GAP_HORIZ = (5, 7)            # endpoint gap for horizontal radiate
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:282:OPEN_END_MARGIN = 3           # min cells from open end to radiate grid edge
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:406:    """Map local (u, v) to grid (r, c) given radiate direction and anchor."""
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:606:    opening: endpoints define the open end; radiate_dir is the cardinal direction (up/down/left/right) pointing outward from the opening, derived from the vector sum of endpoint outward directions
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:607:    placement: closed end >=2 cells from its grid edge; open end >=3 cells from the radiate-edge
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_10.log:614:    location: scattered on bg cells; some in the radiate zone (between opening and grid edge), some elsewhere
