/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/_logs/combo_16.log:606:    opening: endpoints define the open end; radiate_dir is the cardinal direction (up/down/left/right) pointing outward from the opening, derived from the vector sum of endpoint outward directions
